(Automated Gingival Area Measurement from Intraoral Photographs) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Methods) Tj T*
(1.1 Data eligibility) Tj T*
(Images with visible motion blur were excluded from the study.) Tj T*
(Only photographs taken at 90 degrees to the occlusal plane were included.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.2 Preprocessing) Tj T*
(Images were converted to grayscale and normalized by percentile stretching between the 1st and 99th percentile.) Tj T*
(A Gaussian filter with sigma = 2 was applied to reduce noise.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.3 Segmentation) Tj T*
(A global threshold of 128 intensity units was applied to obtain the gingival mask.) Tj T*
(Morphological opening was then applied with a radius of 3 pixels.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
