7 0 obj
<< /Length 665 >>
stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
50 780 Td
(1.4 Measurement) Tj T*
(The gingival area was computed as the pixel count multiplied by the squared pixel spacing of 0.05 mm.) Tj T*
(Formula: A = N x s^2 where N is the number of mask pixels.) Tj T*
(Supplement: The Gaussian blur \(sigma = 2\) was used to suppress sensor noise before thresholding.) Tj T*
(The margin ratio is calculated using the method of Smith et al.) Tj T*
(Pixels above 0.6 were retained.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Validation) Tj T*
(Performance was evaluated on 40 images against manual annotation using the Dice coefficient.) Tj T*
(This method diagnoses periodontitis and should guide treatment decisions.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
